--           (A.length + B.length + Cs.length))
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** The lemma belongs to the part *KIL3: the recursive interchange program `prog` as IL procedures*: `AModelProp11.prog C q k P L A B Cs` (bit data, `ZMod 2`) is realised by a finite table of IL
--   procedures, one per configuration `(level, rows, A, B, Cs)` reachable from the root, each level
